         fhir:comment [ fhir:v "Element `Citation.citedArtifact.version.baseCitation` is part of an existing definition because parent element `Citation.citedArtifact.version` requires a cross-version extension.\nElement `Citation.citedArtifact.version.baseCitation` is not mapped to FHIR R4, since FHIR R5 `Citation` is not mapped.\nElement `Citation.citedArtifact.version.baseCitation` has no mapping targets in FHIR R4. Typically, this is because the element has been added (is a new element).\nWhen referencing a baseCitation, one may inherit any data from the referenced Citation Resource and consider any data in the current Citation Resource as superceding to be version-specific." ]
