         fhir:equivalence [ fhir:v "wider" ] ;
         fhir:comment [ fhir:v "Element `Citation.citedArtifact.contributorship.entry.affiliation` is part of an existing definition because parent element `Citation.citedArtifact.contributorship.entry` requires a cross-version extension.\nElement `Citation.citedArtifact.contributorship.entry.affiliation` is not mapped to FHIR R4, since FHIR R5 `Citation` is not mapped.\nElement `Citation.citedArtifact.contributorship.entry.affiliation` has no mapping targets in FHIR R4. Typically, this is because the element has been added (is a new element).\nIf naming an organization without additional detail or further structured data, the display element within the Reference datatype may be used for a simple string without referencing another resource." ]
